===Etymology===
With -''ch'' from {{term|Lurch|lang=de}}; from {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|mol|lang=gmh}}, {{term|molle|lang=gmh}} ‘lizard, newt’, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|mol|lang=goh}} (800), {{term|mollo|mol(l)o|lang=goh}} (1100), {{term|molm|lang=goh}} (9th c.), {{term|molt|lang=goh}} (12th c.), from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{recons|mul-|lang=gem-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|de}} {{recons|melh₂-|lang=ine-pro}} ‘dark color’. More at {{l|de|malen}}.

